{
  "$comment": "apstat-park is DERIVED from two parent repos until the teacher retires them. `node sync/sync.mjs` rebuilds every mirror target from the parents' HEAD. Never hand-edit a file under a mirror target: encode the change as a transform in sync/transforms.mjs, or make it in the parent. Paths in `exclude` are relative to the mirror's `from` root and are gitignore-style globs.",
